+/*
+ * GPU aperture registers at 0x05000000. Byte offsets are the public A6XX
+ * register numbers times four: drm/msm gpu_read() does
+ * readl(gpu->mmio + (reg << 2)). Only registers defined in the public
+ * A6XX database are listed; there is no chip-ID register there, so the
+ * live-DT chip ID (0x06010800, Adreno 618) stays the identity reference.
+ */
